window.products.push({"id":944040,"name":"BRASSTAR Golden Resin Feng Shui Statue Chinese Zodiac Animal Dragon Home Office Table Top Decor Figurine Gift Collection PTZY116","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l0YcWbxxL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"Introduction: The Chinese zodiac is a classification scheme that assigns an animal and its reputed attributes to each year in a repeating 12-year cycle. In order, the 12 Chinese horoscope animals are: Rat, Ox, Tiger, Rabbit, Dragon, Snake, Horse, Goat, Monkey, Rooster, Dog, Pig. Each Chinese zodiac animal has personality traits assigned to it by the ancient Chinese. Chinese people believe these traits will be embodied in people, according to their zodiac sign. Symbolic Meaning: Dragon is a symbol of strength and inflexibility while Snake symbolizes flexibility. Product Specifications: -Theme and Color: Chinese zodiac animals, golden.  -Finnish Type: Electroplated gold finish. Glossy surface, very shiny.  -Material: Resin with a glass base. -Size: 3.5*2.4*3.3 inches.  -Net Weight: 10.3 oz.  -Package Content: 1*golden statue. Product Description: Glossy surface finish, the statues are very luxurious pieces adding to your space. Electroplated and beautifully gilded, the sculptures shine like the sun. They are also Feng Shui charms since gold objects or statue covered in gold is the ideal talisman to protect its owner from evil spirits.  The statue is mounted on a base carved with Chinese character blessings. It is a great gift to give,   We thank you for choosing our product.  If you have any further questions, please contact us. ❤With Blessing❤","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l0YcWbxxL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BRASSTAR","source_asin":"B07TCDZ1MR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944040","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TCDZ1MR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TCDZ1MR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
