window.products.push({"id":944156,"name":"Luigi Bormioli Esperienze Champagne/Prosecco Stemware, Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YA9ShkVPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Luigi Bormioli used only the finest sands and raw materials to produce crystalline glass that is purely transparent, completely free from tarnishes, tints, and imperfections. Through an innovative cold-crack procedure and careful fire-polishing, the rims of Luigi Bormioli stems and tumblers retain the beadless edge found on the world's finest crystal. Designed with Italian precision and manufactured with Italian craftmanship, Luigi Bormioli's blown crystal glass provides you with the elegance and practicality that you deserve. Dishwasher safe yet beautiful enough for all of your entertainment needs, our stemware, tumblers and serveware allow you to experience fine Italian glassware while meeting the demands of your everyday life. Amazon.com Inspired by the ripples produced by a single raindrop on water, renowned Venetian glass designer Frederico DeMajo discovered a new way for wine enthusiasts to enjoy their favorite vintages. A member of the innovative Esperienze collection, this set of four 10-ounce Champagne/Prosecco flutes specializes in the sparkling varieties with tall, slanted bowls that prolong the ideal chill and wavy bottom contours that encourage the wine to quickly oxygenate for the best bouquet and flavor. Poised on an elongated round stem and generous base, the result is a graceful and refined silhouette appropriate for both daily and formal dining. Esperienze stemware is blown from pure lead-free crystal for traditional quality, flawless clarity, and reassuring weight. This handsome set goes safely into the dishwasher between uses. It is made in Italy and comes packaged in an attractive gift box. --Kara Karll","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51YA9ShkVPS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Luigi Bormioli","source_asin":"B000EN831Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944156","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EN831Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EN831Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
