window.products.push({"id":944199,"name":"Black Satin Vanilla Large 3-Wick Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IIHbYVrRL._AC_.jpg","description":"The majestic beauty of Madagascar awaits you whenever you decide to indulge in the adventurous aroma of this Black Satin Vanilla candle. If you're a big fan of vanilla scented candles, and our popular Goose Creek 3-Wick Candles, this beautiful candle from our World Traveler Collection is sure to become one of your favorites. Simply light the lead-free wicks to go on a journey across the world to the land of Madagascar where you can find yourself in the middle of an exotic paradise filled with unique wildlife and alluring scents that make you want to enjoy everything this ancient island paradise has to offer. Located off the eastern coast of Africa, Madagascar intrigues with its towering volcano mountains, tropical rainforests and sandstone cliffs. And yes, it's also home to quite a number of lemurs, chameleons and plant life, including baobab and octopus trees. Our candle, inspired by this richly diverse island, entices you with notes of rich vanilla, cashmere, light patchouli and sandalwood. The premium soy wax blend of this candle produces over 35 hours of aromatic burn time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51IIHbYVrRL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Goose Creek","source_asin":"B09NS2T2MC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NS2T2MC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NS2T2MC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
