window.products.push({"id":944246,"name":"YMWLKJ V8 Battery Adapter for Dyson, V8 Adapter fit for Dewalt 20V Battery to Replace for Dyson V8 Battery, Great for Dyson V8 Absolute Cordless V8 Fl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YluLy8fWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Replace for De Walt to for Dyson V8 Batteries】YMWLKJ V8 Adapter compatible with Dewalt 20V Battery, DCB200 DCB201 DCB203 DCB204 DCB205 DCB206 DCB207 DCB181-XJ, DCB181, DCB180, N123283, N123282, DCB201-2, DCB606-2, DCB609-2 to replace for Dyson V8 battery ,use for Dyson V8 Series Vacuum Cleaner. Comply with FCC RoHS and CE security testing standards. 【Compatible with Dyson V8 Cordless Stick & Handheld Vacuum Cleaner】Compatible with Dyson V8 Absolute, SV10, V8 Motorhead, V8 Fluffy, V8 Animal, V8 Animal Pro+, V8 Animal Extra, V8 Mattress, V8 Cord-free, V8 Trigger, V8 Total Clean, V8 Auto + Boot vacuum cleaner and more. (NOT for V6 V7,V10, V11 vacuum ). 【High Quality】Our V8 adapter has Multiple Safe Protections, Made of fireproof ABS material, it provides over-voltage, over-current, overheats and short circuit protection. Diagnostics with indicator light to communicate battery working status. “Green Light” means normal work, “Red Light” means the battery is running out. 【More options & Longer Run Time】If you have this V8 universal attachment adapter, just need to snap on battery adapter to for De walt Battery, which means you can use the V8 Series vacuum cleaner without theV8 original battery. How smart and What a convenience!( NOT for V6, V7, V10, V11, DC45 vacuum ) 【We Should Know】DW20V8 Adapter has low-pressure control. When the vacuum cleaner is used at high speed, the power is very large, and the voltage will drop sharply. When the battery is low, the control voltage can easily be reached, causing the battery to stop working. After stopping use, the original voltage will be restored. If this problem occurs, please fully charge the battery before use. (The usage time depends on the installed battery capacity. The adapter cannot be used to charge the battery.) Recommended to use batteries with a capacity of at least 4Amh","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61YluLy8fWL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YMWLKJ","source_asin":"B0C6X93FR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944246","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6X93FR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6X93FR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
