window.products.push({"id":944388,"name":"Pack of 2 Silicone Cooking Spatula, Heat Resistant Solid Turner, Non Stick Slotted Spatulas with Wooden Short Handle,Ideal Wood Kitchen Utensils Set f","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ICNHN03yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KITCHENWARE YOU DESERVE : Unlike other ordinary sellers, we pay more attention to the safety of product materials.Our silicone cooking spatulas set is made of food-grade silicone, free of BPA. Even at high temperatures of 446℉ (230℃), there is no need to worry about melting or deforming. At the same time, the soft silicone head won't scratch the coating, which can better protect your pot. THE MOST INTIMATE DESIGN: The slender handle is made of high quality acacia wood, with unique texture and not easy to deform. The handle surface of the spatula is polished smooth, comfortable to hold, and not easy to heat, so that you can enjoy a pleasant cooking time and better protect your hands from being burned. EASY TO CLEAN: In order to better extend the life of the wood, it is recommended to wash it by hand. Use a soft cloth after each use, you can easily clean and remove excess fat and food .The design of the round hanging hole makes it easier to dry. MEET YOUR DIFFERENT DAILY USE : This set contains 2 different styles of wooden turner. The soft food-grade silicone is designed for noise-free cooking.Thin and flexible edge,is ideal for flipping,frying, turning eggs,meat,fish. You can use our multifunctional wooden spatula set to complete a delicious food with your family or children. This must be a very happy thing! OUR SERVICE: No one is born to be a good cook, but good kitchenware often gets twice the result with half the effort. Bundlepro is a trusted kitchen utensil expert, we have been committed to providing customers with the highest quality kitchen utensils. If you have any questions about our products, please don't hesitate to contact us, we will be very happy to serve you !","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ICNHN03yL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUNDLEPRO","source_asin":"B0B4W64TXB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944388","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4W64TXB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4W64TXB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
