window.products.push({"id":944540,"name":"4th of July Decorations for Home, DECSPAS Large Size Red Truck American Flag Ornaments Memorial Day Decor, PROUD TO BE AN AMERICAN WELCOME Sign Patrio","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OYzLAYrFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🗽【4th of July Decorations】 - DECSPAS 4th of July decor consists of a red truck ornament connected with a rectangular wood-colored block. There is a big American flag flying outside of the truck with ”PROUD TO BE AN AMERICAN” painted and blue white stars embellished. A string of wooden beads is hung beside the car. The lower block is lettered with conspicuous white “WELCOME”. Just put this fourth of July decor on the tabletop to show your patriotism and it could definitely spice up your home! 🚀【Create Patriotic Atmosphere】 - Classic red, white and blue colors matching which is a must for Independence Day would make your space full of energy. The Stars and Stripes as one of the national symbols of the United States could declare your national confidence. Decorate DECSPAS July 4th decorations, add charming and strong American feelings to your home. Gather with those who encourage you to be strong and celebrate the hard-won freedom together! 🎈【Multiple Uses】 - The size of this set of patriotic decor is 9.3 x 7.5 x 1 inches, which can fit for any patriotic themed occasion like 4th of July, Veterans day, Memorial day and Independence Day. Can be placed on the table or anywhere you want in the living room, dining room, office, bookshelf, wall shelves, fireplace, kitchen and entryway. Show this 4th of July decor on a prominent place in your home and your guests will feel your deep love for this powerful country. 💙【National Holiday Gift】 - A personalized independence day gift will touch the heart of the receiver, and will always find a very special place. DECSPAS fourth of July decorations feature patriotic-themed design and are amazing as presents to give to your family, lover, friends, classmates, colleagues to ignite the patriotic enthusiasm in the hearts of every American that day. Distinctive appearance would speak volumes of your taste in art. Be sure to delight people year after year! 🎉【Premium Material】 - These fourth of July decorations for the home are made of solid MDF material which is no odor, thick, non-broken and safe to use. Careful polish creates smooth surface without burrs. Superior printing technique keeps those blocks away from fading. The ink printed on this Americana decor is nice to avoid erasing the fonts. Excellent craftsmanship gives this July 4th decor durability and extends its service life.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OYzLAYrFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DECSPAS","source_asin":"B0B1Q5RJD4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944540","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1Q5RJD4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1Q5RJD4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
