window.products.push({"id":944564,"name":"Time Vault Treasures Moose & Bear Vinyl Record Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UKGtmkpGL._AC_SL1212_.jpg","description":"Wait until you see one actually hanging on a wall, unbelievably gorgeous! We have over 200 designs, so if you don't see what you like, just ask! And if we don't have it, talk to us about custom ordering something for a very fair price. An *American* made and cut vinyl album clock cut with precision to make the most unique gift or decoration imaginable. These are made with authentic 12 inch vinyl LP's(albums) with a new decorative label applied in the center and a clock that is completely silent (no tic toc here)! It is battery operated and takes only one AA battery. A built in hangar on the back of the clock mechanism makes it as simple as possible to hang. We have many designs so if you don't see something you are looking for, just ask! We will custom make designs too so don't be afraid to ask for anything, whether it be for your business, wedding, hobby or simply adding a name, etc. extremely unique and personal! The style/shape of the clock hands may vary from the picture, but the color will remain the same. ***Please keep in mind these are made from used, authentic 12 inch vinyl albums, and although we seriously try to use ones that are as new looking as possible, there can be blemishes or small scratches etc. Don't let this scare you, our final product quality is top notch! **","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UKGtmkpGL._AC_SL1212_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Time Vault Treasures","source_asin":"B0799S11JS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944564","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0799S11JS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0799S11JS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
