window.products.push({"id":944579,"name":"True Soar Purple Winged Corkscrew, Self Centering Worm, Bottle Opener","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S6b7Q4XIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fast and foolproof, the winged corkscrew is a classic for a reason. Our Soar™ Purple Winged Corkscrew features a colorful purple finish, self-centering worm and built-in bottle opener. Screw the corkscrew into the cork and then press down the lever arms to remove the cork in one easy motion. What can we say? It’s pretty fly. All metal construction Lever arms Integrated bottle opener","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61S6b7Q4XIS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"True","source_asin":"B088LGDW7T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944579","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088LGDW7T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088LGDW7T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":944580,"name":"Mellowdy Shawl Blanket Pillow 2-in-1 for Office, Work from Home (Blossom Pink, 40x60) - Wearable Adult Swaddle Snuggle Coat Poncho, Airplane Travel Bl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IDz1l4YhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Simple Design: a solid blanket at its core with added buttons and reinforced edge seam for durability. It's not flashy so that you can use it both in home and office settings, indoors and outdoors. Roughly 40\" W X 60\" L when lying flat as a blanket. Easy to use: making this blanket into a coat is straightforward - just clipping a few buttons in place then you are done. It'll stay on comfortably just like your everyday coat so that you can go about your day - making/drinking coffee, grabbing the morning paper, tackling the next PowerPoint for that important call, all the while keeping you warm and cozy. Multipurpose: double as a pillow or use it as a regular blanket. It comes with a pillowcase to store the blanket when you don't need it. Stuffing the blanket in the case would make it a perfect pillow - placing it on your chair to provide additional lumbar support for prolonged sitting session; or toss it on your couch to join the pillow family. You can also use it simply as a regular blanket by unclipping the buttons. Material and care: it's made of super soft velvety fabric, machine washable & dryable. Please follow wash instructions to make the most out of the blanket's use-life. Made in OEKO-TEX Standard 100 factory, one of the world's best-known labels for textiles tested for harmful substances. You can be confident that our blankets meet high safety and environmental standards.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IDz1l4YhL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mellowdy","source_asin":"B09PGSHWVY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944580","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PGSHWVY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PGSHWVY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
