window.products.push({"id":944621,"name":"BYO by BUILT NY Neoprene Wine/Water Bottle Tote, Ditzy Floral","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nWnwFr+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This BYO by Built NY neoprene wine tote insulates two bottles, keeping your favorite beverage at the perfect temperature. Neoprene is tough and protects against, spills, splashes, bumps, and drops, making it perfect for safeguarding the things you love. This light-weight tote stores flat when not in use. Soft-grip handles make it easy to carry. Available in a variety of fun patterns, is the 'must-have' wine tote. Wherever this product goes, the good times follow. Perfect for toting libations to parties, it also makes a fantastic gift for the host. That is, if you can resist keeping it for yourself. Red or white, sparkling or still, BYO by Built's original totes are the carrying method of choice whether you're an oenophile or teetotaler. Machine wash cold, hang dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nWnwFr+9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BYO","source_asin":"B01CT9HUNE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01CT9HUNE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01CT9HUNE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
