window.products.push({"id":944699,"name":"Circle Egg Ring Egg Round Set Stainless Steel Ring Non-rusting Non-stick Round Egg Pancake Sandwich English Muffin Maker Handy Kitchen Tool for Frying","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DLUlw5+4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"[HIGH QUALITY] - The egg ring is made of non-toxic and tasteless stainless steel, non-rusting, non-deformable, non-stick, it can help you to make a round omelette egg perfectly. [EASY TO USE] - Just lift up the foldable handle of the round egg cooker, place on your electric griddle or frying pan, then coat with oil and get to fried egg. [EASY TO CLEAN] - Due to the stainless steel metal material of the omelet, the pancake can be quickly cleaned with a small amount of degreased water. [MULTI-FUNCTIONS] - Ideal for hamburgers, breads, eggs, omelets, breakfast sandwiches, egg muffins and pancakes. Deep enough to easily add extras like veggies, cheese, or cooked ham or bacon. [ENJOY YOUR FOOD] - Non-stick round ring for eggs, muffins, pancake, make your own sandwiches at home, this is a must if want a nice shaped egg for a sandwich, love it! The egg circle is a must-have tool for perfect and consistent egg cooking. These stainless steel egg rings help you fry your eggs with precision, giving them a perfectly circular shape that will impress your guests every time. With its sturdy and durable construction, the egg circle is built to last. The metal circle for cooking egg is perfect for frying eggs, making pancakes, or creating round cookies, and it will never lose its shape. The egg circle is easy to use and clean, making it the ideal kitchen gadget for anyone who loves to cook. Just place the egg ring set on a frying pan or griddle, crack an egg into it, and watch as your perfectly round egg takes shape. This circular egg ring is perfect for cooking eggs of all kinds. You can use it to fry eggs over easy, medium, or hard, or even use it to create a delicious egg sandwich. The egg circle for frying pan is also perfect for making multiple eggs at once, which is perfect for a breakfast or brunch. Whether you're a professional chef or just an amateur cook, the egg circle is a must-have tool for your kitchen. With its high-quality stainless steel construction, easy-to-use design, and ability to make perfect eggs every time, the egg circle is a product that you won't want to be without.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61DLUlw5+4L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASFSKY","source_asin":"B08TLMMVKQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944699","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08TLMMVKQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08TLMMVKQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
