window.products.push({"id":944821,"name":"Tiptiper Full Size Bed Frame with Headboard Storage, Upholstered with LED Lights and Charging Station, Platform Bed with Sturdy Wooden Slats Support, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FD5wd6B5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【RGB LED Lights in the Headboard】The LED lights can be controlled by remote control or by mobile APP. Bring a dreamy feel to your room. Controlled by the remote control, there are 16 colors, 6 brightness adjustments and 4 lighting modes. With APP control, the LED light has more than 60,000 colors to choose from, the brightness can be adjusted, and there are other modes to change the color of the light: style mode, music mode, microphone mode. In addition, there is a timing function controlled by the APP, which can preset the time to turn on and off the LED light. 【Charging Station with Outlets & USB Ports】The power strip built into the headboard has 2 outlets and 2 USB ports, making it very convenient for you to charge your phone, tablet, headphones and other electronic devices within your reach or use a book light to easily read while lying in bed. 【Storage Headboard with Adjustable Height】The storage headboard has 3 compartments and shelves. It can also be opened and has an internal storage space, which allows you to store some bedding, books, decorations, or other items. In addition, there are small cloth pockets on both sides of the headboard, where the remote control, mobile phone, and glasses can be easily placed. Headboard Adjustable Height: 43.7\"-47.7\". It can hold full size mattresses of different thicknesses from 10 inches to 14 inches. 【Sturdy Construction & Strong Support】Our stylish and functional fabric upholstered platform bed has 12 sturdy wood slats, 2 metal supports, and 9 support legs(middle 3 legs are height adjustable), each slat is 2''W, slat spacing is 3.9''W. The sturdy metal and wood framework system provides strong support easily up to 880 LBS, giving your mattress the support and protection it needs! This Dark Grey Bed brings classic style and convenient functionality to any room. 【Modern Style】The classic neutral linen fabric combined with the rustic brown wood plank is perfect for a variety of bedroom styles and adds glamour to the room. And the linen fabric on the bed frame is skin-friendly, breathable and wear-resistant. 【Easy to Assemble】This upholstered bed with storage headboard is well packaged in 1 box. Everything you need to install this platform bed is included in the shipping box (all parts, tools, instructions). Assembly can be completed in a very short time. If you have any questions, please contact us and we will try our best to answer them. 【No Box Spring Needed】The base of this platform bed has a solid wood and metal support structure system, 12 solid wood strips, 2 metal supports and 9 legs (including floor protectors) provide a flat and firm structure for your mattress a stable surface. Wood and metal base frames support latex, memory foam, or mattresses very well. This means your bed can support any kind of full size mattress to maximize your comfort. No spring box is required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81FD5wd6B5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiptiper","source_asin":"B0BM4C4B9L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944821","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BM4C4B9L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BM4C4B9L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
