window.products.push({"id":944902,"name":"Paris Hilton Cookie Decorating Set with Nonstick Cookie Baking Sheet, Iconic Cookie Cutter Shapes, Reusable Piping Bags and Decorating Tips, Silicone ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+QWF27DsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Never let your cookie jar run empty with Paris Hilton's cookie baking and decorating set. The perfect baking set for channeling the aspiring baker within. Make delicious cookies with 3 iconic cookie cutters. Fun shapes of all the things considered a girl's best friend: unicorn, dog, and diamond. Not just for cookies, get creative and use the cookie cutters as a sandwich cutter to add some flare to your lunch box or bento box. Another fun idea, bake some dog treats for your fur kids. The silicone spatula is great for stirring, spreading, scraping and flipping your batter and won't scratch surfaces. The baking sheet is made from carbon steel and has rolled edges to prevent warping. You can bake 'til your heart's content. Personalize your baked goods with reusable piping bags and decorating tips. Not just for cookies, you can use the pastry decorating set for a birthday cake or cupcake decorations, candies, pies and other pastries. Comes with 4 beautiful gold paper doilies to add a dash of glamour and plate your dessert in style. Let the dishwasher do your dirty work. Clean-up is easy as these pans, cookie cutters, decorating tips and spatula are dishwasher safe. To extend the life of your baking set, we recommend top rack only for the cookie cutters, decorating tips and spatula. Hand wash the piping bags to keep them in great shape. The ultimate gift for a birthday, holiday/Christmas, dog, diamond, or unicorn lover, or the bakester/pastry chef in your life. Check out all Paris Hilton offers to make your home and kitchen more glamorous, so you too can be a #bossbabe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+QWF27DsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Paris Hilton","source_asin":"B0B2LY775N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944902","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2LY775N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2LY775N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
