window.products.push({"id":944908,"name":"Thanksgiving Foam Soap Bottle - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w8QPDHb4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add some fun to your soap dispensing with one of our foaming soap dispensers! These soap dispenser pumps, when personalized, will add a charming touch of personality and color to your space! They will look lovely on the side of any kitchen or bathroom sinks. Customize some for your home, or pair with a few other home goods products as a thoughtful housewarming gift!This soap dispenser is made of a robust plastic and has a clear base. The included soap pump is available in black or white color. This dispenser is 6.5 inches tall, 3 inches wide, and 2 inches deep. We display your customized designs on the front and back sides of these foaming hand soap dispensers.To fill your bathroom soap dispenser, we suggest filling it with foaming soap or filling one-quarter of the bottle with soap, and then the remaining space with water to allow the nozzle to create the foaming effect. To pump, follow the \"open\" curved arrow on the nozzle to line the nozzle up with the indentation at the base of the nozzle.Design Shown: Thanksgiving (#512749)Features:==================================== * [Quality Material]: Made from robust, clear plastic, ensuring durability and longevity. * [Color Options]: Comes with a foaming soap nozzle available in black or white. * [Product Size]: Measures 6.5\" in height, 3\" in width, and 2\" in depth, perfect for various spaces. * [Ease of Use]: Simply fill with foaming soap or a mix of liquid soap and water for a convenient, easy-to-pump design.Usage Instructions:==================================== * Fill with foaming soap * Or fill a quarter of the bottle with normal soap and the remaining with water * Follow “open” curved arrow on nozzle to pump * Line up nozzle with indentation on the base of the nozzle","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71w8QPDHb4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RNK Shops","source_asin":"B017V5ISS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B017V5ISS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B017V5ISS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
