window.products.push({"id":944930,"name":"BESTEK 350W 2 Speed 4-in-1 Smart Stick Hand Mixer Blender Set with Food Chopper, Whisk and Beaker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lmn93mHZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The BESTEK 4 in 1 Stainless Hand Blender Stick is perfectly for mixing and milkshakes! Perfect Kitchen Companion! Feature: -Stick design reaches into pots, pitchers & bowls to extend your blending options even further.  -Ergonomic design for a comfort hold & more control.  -Easy clean-up and anti-slipping.  500ml Food Chopping Bowl The super sharp blades can chop foods whether wet, dry, including meat,leaves,cheese,onion,herbs,garlic,carrots,walnuts,almonds,prunes etc. A quick pulse will leave foods chunky, or blend until smooth to make sauces, salsas, pesto, houmous and more. extremely hard food such as ice cubes, nutmeg, coffee beans and grains will not be chopped. The 350W motor allows effortless blending! Powerful yet quiet. Blender Stick and 800ml Beaker The hand blender is perfectly suited for preparing dips, sauces, soups,mayonnaise and baby food as well as for mixing and milkshakes. Caution: Don’t operate food without water! Don’t operate the food longer than 1 minute at each time! let the blender stick rest 1 minute when operate the blender stick twice Whisk Attachment the whisk perfectly used for whipping cream or beating fluffy egg whites and mixing sponges and Ready-mix desserts.  Please don’t use the whisk longer than 2 minutes. Specifications: Power: 350W Max Speed: 2 speeds with inching switch Material: Stainless steel and BPA free plastic Package Contents: 1 * Bestek Hand Blender 1 * 500ml chopping bowl 1 * 800ml measuring cup 1 * Whisk 1 * Manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Lmn93mHZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BESTEK","source_asin":"B073P3XTJC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944930","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B073P3XTJC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B073P3XTJC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":944931,"name":"SoftHeat | Smart Heated Electric Mattress Pad with Safe & Warm Low Voltage Technology, Full, Dobby Stripe (Full)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E7oDjNUwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"We’ve designed a safe and incredibly soft electric mattress pad that not only warms your bed, but also rejuvenates it. Due to the all over penetrating warmth of this low-voltage mattress pad, you’ll start saving money on your energy bill while lowering your thermostat. The 233 thread-count 80% poly/20% cotton dobby stripe shell is incredibly soft, soothing and supportive. Constructed within the pad is the patented Safe & Warm low-voltage technology. This low-voltage mattress pad includes a small power supply box that changes 120 volt AC home current into non-hazardous low voltage DC current (very similar to a battery) to provide warmth, protection and safety even if the pad becomes wet. Unlike other warming pads with their thick bulky wires, the heating wires in the Soft Heat pads are so small, they are virtually unnoticeable. During construction we place the ultra thin wires 3-inches apart and evenly distribute them from head to toe. The benefit to you is a pad that gives more of an even heat and has no annoying hot or cold spots. The full size pad comes standard with one easy to read, easy to turn, non-slip computerized controller to adjust the temperature of the pad. For cozy sheets before bed time, it has an automatic pre-heat and hold feature. You simply turn it on and the pad will warm up on HI until it reaches the temperature that you pre set your dial on, and then adjusts itself to hold it there. For your safety convenience and power conservation, it has an automatic shut off feature that will shut the pad off after 10 hours just in case you forget. It also comes standard with built in over-temperature protection for that extra bit of safety and peace of mind. On the controller, a giant backlit display with auto dimming feature provides more convenience for night time adjustments with out having to turn on the lights. A fitted skirt keeps it all in place to eliminate shifting or bunching and promote better sheet fit. Easy care machine wash and tumble dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71E7oDjNUwL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SoftHeat","source_asin":"B07R54TJS7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944931","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R54TJS7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R54TJS7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
