window.products.push({"id":944960,"name":"Armen Living Alpine Dining Chair in Charcoal Fabric and Walnut Wood Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":136.68,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41snY44XgpL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Armen Living Alpine mid-century dining chair is practical in function and elegant in appearance. The sturdy back and leg construction, coupled with the fabric seat lining give the Alpine a versatile and contemporary appearance. This elegant contemporary chair is perfect for the modern dining room but can also function as additional seating in any room of the house. This piece is both simplistic and chic that you can play up or down in any room in your home. It is the perfect size for small spaces such as dorm rooms or apartments or it can be use to entertain large gathering in style. This item features a medium high cup style back with a convenient arm rest. It's cushion back is ideal for posture alignment and an unmatched support for days on end. The foundation of the product is supported solid wood for a sturdy and stylish aesthetic without comprising the practicality and functionality of this piece. This item is a versatile piece that can be ideal for dining, kitchen or even home office desk chairs. This product ships in one box with easy and quick set up. We stand by the quality, the craftsmanship and the integrity of our product by offer 1-year warranty for all our products. The Alpine chair comes in two exceptional upholstery choices: charcoal fabric and gray faux leather. The Alpine is available in three styles: charcoal, gray, and green fabric. Product Dimensions: 19\"W x 22\"D x 31\"H SH: 19\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41snY44XgpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Armen Living","source_asin":"B072BYKXB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-944960","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072BYKXB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072BYKXB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
